[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614066062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102024#issuecomment-2614066062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102024","id":2614066062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bz3uO","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T18:57:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T19:05:52Z","body":"This PR also prevents the editor from breaking when running on smartphone.\r\n\r\nBefore (and this is one of the best-case scenarios, because words in English are quite short and that's why only a small part of the right dock is out of screen):\r\n![Screenshot_2025-01-25-21-36-00-345_org godotengine editor v4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff7ddfe3-0df9-4141-b3ab-8a19c3026ade)\r\nAfter:\r\n![Screenshot_2025-01-25-21-51-17-887_org godotengine editor v4 debug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac6d8151-392c-4214-a704-9c489a4b419a)\r\n\r\nBoth captured on Redmi Note 8 Pro.\r\n\r\nSo I think this could be treated not only like enhancement, but also like bugfix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614066062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614898325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102024#issuecomment-2614898325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102024","id":2614898325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b3C6V","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T05:50:51Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T06:56:04Z","body":"After some thought, I came up with a slightly different idea.\r\n\r\nCurrently this is done with just replacing `HBoxContainer` with `FlowContainer`, so `Frame #` field will change its line position depending on available space:\r\n![406681951-ac6d8151-392c-4214-a704-9c489a4b419a](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1dc2173d-3439-4530-80d4-888d3f1f0395)\r\n\r\nI think keeping position of this `SpinBox` might be important. So I suggest move back to `HBoxContainer` and put everything except  `Frame #` label and `SpinBox` into `FlowContainer`, so it will look something like that (`Frame #` label and `SpinBox` are always at top right corner):\r\n![406681951-ac6d8151-392c-4214-a704-9c489a4b419a](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85ffa247-ee9e-449e-a73b-b57b3ad6468e)\r\n\r\nNote that this is mockup, I didn't try it yet.\r\n\r\n@Calinou what do you think, is it good idea? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614898325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616664717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102024#issuecomment-2616664717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102024","id":2616664717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b9yKN","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"